    "Grid mapping: Each step array has 8 positions for rows 0-7",
    "Row 0 → Note 48 (max_step=31), Row 1 → Note 49 (max_step=30), Row 2 → Note 50 (max_step=29), Row 3 → Note 51 (max_step=15), Row 4 → Note 52 (max_step=14), Row 5 → Note 53 (max_step=13), Row 6 → Note 54 (max_step=4)",
    "Timing: advance_step() is called every 6 ticks (when tick % 6 == 0)",
    "FIXED: Check happens BEFORE increment, so step 0 happens at tick 0",
    "Tick 0: step 0 processed, Tick 6: step 1 processed, Tick 12: step 2 processed, etc.",
    "Grid data from test_pattern_1.json:",
    "  step 0: [15,0,0,1,0,0,0,0] → rows 0,3 → notes 48,51",
    "  step 1: [0,0,0,1,1,0,0,0]  → rows 3,4 → notes 51,52",
    "  step 2: [0,1,0,1,0,1,0,0]  → rows 1,3,5 → notes 49,51,53",
    "  step 3: [0,0,0,1,0,1,1,0]  → rows 3,5,6 → notes 51,53,54",
    "  step 4: [15,0,1,0,0,0,1,0] → rows 0,2,6 → notes 48,50,54",
    "  step 5: [0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0]  → no notes",
    "  step 6: [0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0]  → row 1 → note 49",
    "  step 7: [0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0]  → no notes",
    "  step 8: [15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0] → row 0 → note 48"
  ],
